entity_ids_put_back.description:
These entities were given other ids, and GlucoCraft gave them their original ids back:

{changed}

GlucoCraft's cards, its dashboard and the wall panels find these entities by their original ids, so GlucoCraft keeps them. This is necessary so that GlucoCraft can continue to function properly. The name shown for an entity or a device can be changed freely: if Home Assistant offers to change the entity ids as well, leave them as they are. This notice stays until it is dismissed.
